              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho abe ari we musaba imvura ngw igwe mu gihe c’itasura, muyisabe Uhoraho arema imiravyo; na we azobaha imvura y’umuvuvu, umuntu wese amumereze imirima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
